Scope of the LICENSE file
-------------------------

The MIT license in LICENSE covers only the original source code and text
written for this port: main.js, game/ (except game/art.js and game/levels.js,
which are generated from the original game's data), tests/, the scripts in
tools/, and the text of README.md and docs/.

It does not cover the third-party material listed below.

Original game
-------------

Sports Heads Football is a game by Mousebreaker / kChamp. The graphics,
animations, sound effects, texts and level layouts used by this port were
extracted or derived from the original Flash (SWF) release, including:

  assets/flash/      artwork and animation frames
  assets/audio/      sound effects and music
  assets/save/       memory card icon, built from the default head sprite
  game/art.js        sprite metadata
  game/levels.js     level layouts
  tools/blender/head1_contour.json, tools/blender/icon-texture.png
                     contour and texture cut from the default head sprite
  tools/icon_mesh.json  mesh extruded from that contour
  docs/screenshots/, docs/source-evidence.json
                     captures and an inventory that show or derive from the
                     original game

All rights to this material remain with their owners. It is included only so
the port can run, and no ownership of it is claimed. The original SWF is not
distributed. SHA-256 of the release this port was built from:
d1d3c94dff217f402c26e06e386ed3d831055ebdd58c4ee12d8e81d02347554e

If you are a rights holder and want any of this material removed, please open
an issue and it will be taken down.

